sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Child
    participant App as Flutter App
    participant Cache as Firestore Cache and Local Store
    participant API as Callable Squeeze Function
    participant DB as Cloud Firestore

    Child->>App: Open Daily Squeeze
    App->>Cache: Load cached attempt for active child and local date
    App->>API: Start puzzle with child ID, timezone and request ID
    API->>DB: Verify parent owns child
    API->>DB: Resolve canonical daily puzzle date
    API->>DB: Get or create today's protected puzzle
    API->>DB: Get or create child's attempt idempotently
    DB-->>API: Attempt state without target answer
    API-->>App: Attempt ID, range, guesses left and public facts
    App->>Cache: Persist authoritative attempt state

    loop Until solved or guesses exhausted
        Child->>App: Enter whole-number guess
        App->>Cache: Queue guess with idempotency key
        App->>API: Submit guess
        API->>DB: Run transaction and reject duplicate request
        API->>API: Validate guess against protected target
        API->>DB: Save guess and update remaining range atomically
        DB-->>API: Guess transaction committed
        API-->>App: Higher, lower or correct plus next fact
        App->>Cache: Apply state and clear queued event
        App-->>Child: Show feedback and mathematical explanation
    end

    alt Puzzle solved
        API->>DB: Finalize attempt and calculate trusted score
        API->>DB: Update streak, XP, mastery and reward ledger atomically
        DB-->>API: Completion and rewards
        API-->>App: Solved summary and share-safe result
        App->>Cache: Store completed result
        App-->>Child: Show celebration, streak and recap
    else Guesses exhausted
        API->>DB: Finalize unsuccessful attempt
        DB-->>API: Completion without solved reward
        API-->>App: Reveal answer and worked reasoning
        App->>Cache: Store completed result
        App-->>Child: Show reflection and practice suggestion
    else Network unavailable
        App->>Cache: Preserve in-progress UI and queued guess
        App-->>Child: Explain that validation needs a connection
        Cache->>API: Retry with same idempotency key after reconnecting
    end
